[2026-07-24T14:29:40.942Z] Possible reasons for having these kinds of units are:
[2026-07-24T14:29:40.942Z] • A unit may be statically enabled by being symlinked from another unit's
[2026-07-24T14:29:40.942Z]   .wants/, .requires/, or .upholds/ directory.
