[2026-07-24T14:29:40.942Z]   a requirement dependency on it.
[2026-07-24T14:29:40.942Z] • A unit may be started when needed via activation (socket, path, timer,
[2026-07-24T14:29:40.942Z]   D-Bus, udev, scripted systemctl call, ...).
